### Step 2 — Service 1: publisher_mqtt.py (IoT Gateway Simulator)

**Location**: [data pipeline/gateway/](file:///d:/Desktop/sih%202025/data%20pipeline/gateway)
**Dependencies**: `paho-mqtt`, `python-dotenv`

```bash
