## Execution Order

The services must be started in this order due to dependencies:

| Order | Service | Port | Depends On |
|-------|---------|------|------------|
| 0 | Docker (Mosquitto, InfluxDB, Postgres) | 1883, 8086, 5432 | Docker Desktop |
| 1 | Service 2: FastAPI Backend | 8000 | InfluxDB, Postgres |
| 2 | Service 3: Consumer (MQTT Bridge) | — | Mosquitto, FastAPI |
| 3 | Service 1: Publisher (IoT Sim) | — | Mosquitto |
| 4 | Service 4: ML Service | 8001 | InfluxDB, Postgres |
| 5 | Service 5: Frontend | 8080 | FastAPI, ML Service |
